    "substitute_justification": "OQMD is computed by an independent research group (University of Kentucky / Wolverton group) using different DFT settings (VASP, GGA-PBE with its own pseudopotential set and convergence criteria) and a different formation-energy reference scheme than Materials Project. It therefore satisfies the requirement of this experiment -- an independent reference distribution the generator was never trained on -- even though it is not the database named in the manuscript. All numbers below are reported as measured on OQMD, not Alexandria, and this substitution should be reflected in any manuscript text that cites this result.",
